  "description": "Stanza's English NLP pipeline in .NET: tokenization and sentence splitting, multi-word token expansion, part-of-speech tags and morphological features, lemmas, dependency parsing, named entities, constituency parsing and sentence sentiment. Runs Stanza's own pretrained models in managed C# (SIMD kernels, no native dependencies), with output identical to Python Stanza. For NVIDIA GPUs add StanzaSharp.Cuda.",
